; BINDING FANGS, the Naga's rank-II weapon (SP3 Task 1, design ruling 14). SP 1, LIMITED 2
; (charges_max = 2). One profile; the Thrown sub-menu is the engine's own, built from the THROWN tag.
;
; THIS KIT HAS A gear.mw_binding_fangs.effect ROW, the Thermal Death Axe's shape: the card's Effect
; paragraph has nowhere else to live. "can be destroyed even if it has no charges remaining" is NOT
; here - a .tres cannot carry it. It is the whitelist in
; res/engine/character/unit/service/unit_printer.gd_ext.gd, keyed on this file's id.
; No icon_override until SP5 - the integrity guard's deliberate red.
[resource]
